Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:56.78,Title,0,0,0,0,,《神偷奶爸2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:36.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北极圈 最高机密实验室）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,3周了 还是一点头绪都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three weeks, and we're still no close to cracking this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把他带过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right! Bring him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:45.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生日快 艾格妮丝）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有史以来最棒的生日派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best party ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条龙正在逼近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dragon is approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 英勇的骑士要来救我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear not, for here come the valiant knights to save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说她不会来是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean she's not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我后院一大群小女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a backyard full of these little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.75,0:04:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都指望着能看见仙女呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are counting on the visit from the Fairy Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要退款 我要的是仙女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want a refund! I want the Fairy Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了 救人一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我咒你晚上睡不着觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I hope you can't sleep at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你粉碎了小女孩的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you crusher of little girls' dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙女什么时候来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, when's the Fairy Princess coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖住她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stall them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:29.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（魔术表演）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术表演到此为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, that's enough of the magic show!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你们听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去像是魔法仙尘的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounded like the twinkling sounds of magical fairy dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是仙女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Fairy Princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是格鲁花仙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is I, GruTinkerbell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最神奇的仙女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most magical Fairy Princess of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我在这祝愿艾格妮丝小公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here to wish Princess Agnes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙女怎么这么胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you're so fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在糖果屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my house is made of candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,烦心的时候我就会吃糖果逃避现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes, I eat instead of facing my problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙女怎么会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you have…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 去吃蛋糕吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, time for cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 格鲁花仙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, GruTinkerbell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是有史以来最棒的仙女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best Fairy Princess ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气 小女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are welcome, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是你 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's really you, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在装给其他小朋友看呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just pretending for the other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 格鲁 派对狂人先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, Gru, Mister Life of the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 吉莉安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jillian!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这样说有点唐突{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm gonna go out on a limb here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友娜塔莉最近恢复了单身…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my friend Natalie, is recently single, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 连门都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! Get off the limb, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 她很会玩的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! She's a riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱唱卡拉OK 有大把时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sings karaoke, she has a lot of free time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对长相的要求也不高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}looks aren't that important to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔 这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Jill, it's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我自己很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不说娜塔莉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine, forget Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表妹琳达怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about my cousin Linda?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有个女的刚死了老公…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know someone whose husband just died…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.65,0:08:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 没看到你在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I did not see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:10.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（物种 未知）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 凯尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, Kyle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 别尿在我的牵牛花上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, stop! Stop doing your business on the Petunias!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 尿在弗雷德的花上 尿爽点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, go to Fred's. Go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gru?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我没有…什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I didn't, what… Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是反恶人联盟的特工露西·瓦尔德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Lucy Wilde of the AVL.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我走一趟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我…冰冻射线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry, I'm… Freeze Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确的方式是先开枪再喊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should announce your weapons after you fire them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个示范{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,红唇电击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lipstick taser!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,效果真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it works so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我进去 大块头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get, in, there, you, big, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.45,0:12:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟针扎一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pins and needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好 格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉用这种方法把你请来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for our methods in getting you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒不觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以马上再来一次 不骗你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do it again in a heartbeat! I am not gonna lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很享受抓捕他的每一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoyed that. Every second of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉真是爽…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave me bit of a buzz, actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 瓦尔德特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough, Agent Wilde.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 太过分了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is bogus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你们以为自己是谁 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you think you people are, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是反恶人联盟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Anti-Villain League.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个致力于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ultra secret organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗全球规模恶势力的绝密组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dedicated to fighting crime on a global scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢劫银行 我们懒得管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rob a bank, we're not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人放火 还是懒得管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill someone, not our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要是你想融化极地冰盖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were to melt the polar ice caps,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是蒸发富士山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or vaporize Mount Fuji,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷月亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就关我们事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, we notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你没有证据证明是我做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, you got no proof that I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 偷了之后我又放回去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, after I did do that, I put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我们都知道 格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're well aware of that, Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才请你来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是联盟的主席 赛拉斯·兰皮谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the league director, Silas Ramsbottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁股{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦尔德特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Wilde.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有个绝密的实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recently, an entire top secret lab disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在北极圈消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Arctic Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 整个实验室 就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The entire lab, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失了 它去哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone. Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没兴趣知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.89,0:14:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室正在研究PX-41{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lab was devoted to experiments involving PX-41.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种变种血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A transmutation serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我什么是PX-41{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is PX-41, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正很可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般的兔宝宝不是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You usually don't see that in bunnies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you could see,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦落入坏人手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the wrong hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,PX-41血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the PX-41 serum,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能成为地球上最具毁灭性的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be the most devastating weapon on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有十分独特的化学特质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it has a very distinct chemical footprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们利用最新的化学追踪技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, using the latest chem tracking technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天堂商场发现它的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we found traces of it in the Paradise Mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,商场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个犯罪高手就是这群店主之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of these shop owners is a master criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才请你来 作为一名前恶棍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where you come in. As an ex-villain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定了解恶棍的思维和行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know how a villain thinks, and acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是安排你到商场的店铺里当卧底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan is, to set you up undercover at a shop in the mall,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你可以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where hopefully, you'll be able to…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我知道是怎么回事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! I see where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗血的动作冒险剧情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all the "Mission: Impossible" stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的回答是不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在身为人父 还是个守法的商人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a father now. And, a legitimate businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在生产一系列美味的果酱和果冻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am developing a line of delicious jams and jellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,果酱跟果冻啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Jams and jellies".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么态度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.91,0:15:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 老子不干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So thanks, but no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个建议 与其把别人绑来言语相激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's a tip: instead of teasing people, and kidnapping them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如直接给他们打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you should just give them a call!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 屁股先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, Mr. Sheepbutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是兰皮谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsbottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 还是屁股好听些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, like I said it better!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我不该这样说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I probably shouldn't be saying this, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你当恶棍真是棒极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your work as a villain, was kind of, amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你回心转意想大干一场的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you ever wanna get back to doing something awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.16,0:16:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是叫你们去睡觉了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I told you guys to get to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候去约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when are you going on your date?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗 吉莉安小姐说给你安排了约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember? Ms. Jillian said she was arranging a date for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个疯子 我不会去约会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, she is a nutjob and I'm not going on any date.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看电视播的登月报道了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you guys see the moon landing on TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能相信吗 简直酷毙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe it? It's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道吗 - 打扰一下 丽萨 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what? - Excuse me, Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 前几天我跟外星人讲话了 - 不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I talked to alien the other day. - no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他超可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽萨 我在想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lisa, I was wondering…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁摸了丽萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru touched Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽萨得了「格鲁病」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa's got Gruties!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕 怕什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared? Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人 怎么会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.07,0:17:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bonkers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是对约会不感兴趣而已 就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, I've no interest in going on a date, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,结案陈词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Case closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不怕约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 伊迪丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Edith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold the horses,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给谁发短信呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you texting?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有谁 是我朋友艾弗里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one! Just my friend Avery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾弗里 艾弗里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avery. Eh? Avery?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,女生还是男生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a girl's name or a boy's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这重要吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, it doesn't matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是个男生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless it's a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:18:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道为什么你是男生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what makes you a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh, you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是光头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bald head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好光滑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我盯着它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I stare at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在想会不会有小鸡蹦出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and imagine a little chick popping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 艾格妮丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别长大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never get older.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆 发型不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tim, nice haircut!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤米 再坚持一下 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy, hang in there, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到周五了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost Friday!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天这批果冻如何 尼法里奥博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's today's batch, Dr. Nefario?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我研发了新的配方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I developed a new formula which allowed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把各种浆果调成一个味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get every known kind of berry in a one flavor of jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.39,0:19:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个味…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love the flavor of…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难吃吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's horrible, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:19:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经有很大进展了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're making great progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 尝尝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使没人喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because everybody hates it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不代表它不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean it's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Gru. There's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我一直想跟你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been meaning to talk to you about for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀念当恶棍的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss being evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,图谋不轨 大肆犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinister plots, large-scale crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我活着的意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I live for!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得我们的前途不应该仅仅是果冻吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't you think there's more for our future than jelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在考虑加一条果酱生产线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm also considering a line of jams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 我已经另谋出路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, Gru, I've now been recruited elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼法里奥博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Nefario!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟我开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我而言是个好机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a great opportunity for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能过上更邪恶 更入流的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}live a life more evil, more central.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.85,0:21:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来给你送行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us give you, the proper send-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minions!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,向尼法里奥博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The highest honor awarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,致以最崇高的敬意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Dr. Nefario,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.61,0:21:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你多年以来尽心服务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your years of service,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸣屁枪21响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the 21 Fart Gun Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到有22响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh, I counted twenty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 我的朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得再飘一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.46,0:22:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们继续工作吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go about your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经开始想念你们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ehh? Oh, Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们这样做好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we should be doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这是为了他好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's for his own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.75,0:23:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们得选张照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we need to choose a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太吓人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 姑娘们 我要宣布一件大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, girls, I have an announcement to make!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得像哪个名人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what celebrity do you look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.17,0:23:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·威利斯（电影明星）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmmm. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.35,0:23:42.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,矮胖子（《鹅妈妈童谣》中的人物）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humpty Dumpty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:44.18,Title,0,0,0,0,,咕噜（《魔戒》中的人物）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oooh, Gollum!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们在做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.41,0:23:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在帮你网上约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're setting you off for online dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.31,0:23:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay, what!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.85,0:23:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行不行不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.67,0:23:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也该找个伴儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's time for you to get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 别说了 没人要去找伴儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop. No one is ever getting out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.23,0:24:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.28,0:24:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.31,0:24:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 宣布大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for the announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受了一份新工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have accepted a new job!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.11,0:24:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我被一家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have been recruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝密机构聘用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a top secret agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.77,0:24:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务是当卧底 拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go undercover and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去当间谍吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.52,0:24:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.73,0:24:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁要重出江湖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru's back in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.80,0:24:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拥有各种装备 武器 还有靓车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with gadgets, and weapons and cool cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.47,0:24:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.53,0:24:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.72,0:24:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的会拯救世界吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really gonna save the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.63,0:24:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.68,0:25:01.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（秃鹰美发会所）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.85,0:25:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤出好心情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bake My Day".
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.56,0:25:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是杯形蛋糕的做法 我从网上下载的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, here is the cupcake recipe I got off the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.04,0:25:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别洒太多糖霜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't go nuts with the sprinkles!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.55,0:25:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't expecting that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.57,0:25:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是意料之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.17,0:25:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脸上有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you, you got, you got…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.90,0:25:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm… umm… a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.27,0:25:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你擦吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,越擦越脏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhmm, it's just spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.45,0:26:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 我自己擦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, alright. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.78,0:26:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别擦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.55,0:26:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己擦吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚看到的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you just saw there was a little something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.12,0:26:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在研究的新东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working on. It's a combination of.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.77,0:26:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是柔道 以色列防卫术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jujitsu, Krav maga,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.63,0:26:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿兹特克战斗术和小丑舞的结合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aztec warfare, and Krumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.08,0:26:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这太奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.28,0:26:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.90,0:26:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛拉斯派我来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On assignment from Silas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.23,0:26:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的新搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your new partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.10,0:26:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.30,0:26:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用兴奋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, "Yay!".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.86,0:26:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰皮谷没提过搭档的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsbottom didn't say anything about a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.35,0:26:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似是因为你的斑斑劣迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, seems that because of your checkered past,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.35,0:26:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没人愿意跟你合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone else refused to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.33,0:26:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.23,0:26:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺身而出了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stepped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.88,0:26:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新来的 无论如何也得服从命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm new. So I'm gonna have to do what they tell me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.59,0:26:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.63,0:26:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识 他是我的小卒之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he's one of my minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.93,0:26:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该猜到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.65,0:26:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.15,0:27:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dave!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.77,0:27:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面呼叫戴夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth to Dave!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.73,0:27:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在可以走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.95,0:27:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有什么情报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.95,0:27:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌疑人有哪些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.44,0:27:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire them at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.63,0:27:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌疑人一号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First suspect,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.35,0:27:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「红花绿叶」的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The head of Bloom and Top,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.71,0:27:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是「老妈大过天」花店的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}proprietor of the Mum's the World floral shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:27:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.34,0:27:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving on…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.53,0:28:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰德·肯尼 「塞塞熊」的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chad Kenny, owner of "Stuff a Bear".
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.66,0:28:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 我的朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buenos Dias, my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.65,0:28:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华多·裴瑞兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eduardo Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莎餐厅的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owner of "Salsa & Salsa" Restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.20,0:28:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的店在商场那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在供应早餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now open for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.77,0:28:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 这位是露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru! And this is Lucy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.62,0:28:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打烊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.82,0:28:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一会会儿就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just gonna take un momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.77,0:28:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开一个盛大的五月五节日派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am throwing a big Cinco De Mayo party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.59,0:28:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要买200个你们这里最好的杯形蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am going to need 200 of your best cupcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.62,0:28:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋糕上装饰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decorated with,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.64,0:28:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥国旗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Mexican Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.14,0:28:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,国旗是这个样子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.07,0:28:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,意下如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.64,0:28:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我得走了 就这么定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I have to go. It's all settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下礼拜来拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pick them up next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.88,0:28:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空过来串门吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come by if you get a chance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.26,0:29:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到 商场大家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And welcome, to the Mall family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.06,0:29:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}El Macho!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.23,0:29:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.13,0:29:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… what couldn't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.34,0:29:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙和20年前的一个恶人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy, looks exactly like a villain named,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.34,0:29:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"El Macho"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.56,0:29:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得一模一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from about 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.83,0:29:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心狠手辣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个危险人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.80,0:29:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,人如其名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as the name implies,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.05,0:29:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}very macho!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.76,0:29:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以赤手空拳去抢劫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a reputation of pulling a heist,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.46,0:29:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而闻名于世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}using only his bare hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.70,0:29:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜的是 猛爷跟所有伟人一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but sadly, like all the greats,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.30,0:30:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得太早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}El Macho was gone, too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.76,0:30:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他选择了世间最猛的死法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died in the most macho way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.46,0:30:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑着一条鲨鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riding a shark,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.28,0:30:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸口绑着250磅炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with 250 pounds dynamites strapped to his chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.84,0:30:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳进了一座活火山的喷出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the mouth, of an active volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.36,0:30:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,场面相当壮观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was glorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.34,0:30:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,按你的说法 猛爷不是已经死了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sounds like El Macho's pretty dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.30,0:30:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人找到他的尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never found the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.93,0:30:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到的只有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that was ever retrieved,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.16,0:30:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一坨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a pile,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.33,0:30:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧焦的胸毛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of singed chest hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.80,0:30:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那张脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That face!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.95,0:30:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has got to be El Macho.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.54,0:30:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩夜闯他的餐厅怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say, you and I break into his restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.57,0:30:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.27,0:30:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.72,0:30:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.26,0:30:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果PX-41血清真的在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if anybody in this place has the PX-41 serum,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.17,0:30:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一定在他手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.31,0:30:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 作业做完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, alright, homework done,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.90,0:30:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡衣穿上了 牙也刷了 该睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pyjamas on, teeth brushed, time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.07,0:30:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么那么急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the big hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.30,0:31:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多工作要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, I have a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.12,0:31:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.07,0:31:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of work?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.07,0:31:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very important business.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.88,0:31:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱抱 亲亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hugs, kisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.28,0:31:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 做个好梦 别让臭虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sleep tight, don't let the bed bugs…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.08,0:31:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,吧啦吧啦吧啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah, blah, blah…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.03,0:31:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说过要帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said you'd help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.21,0:31:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,练习母亲节那天的表演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}practice my part for the mother's day show.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.57,0:31:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来听听看 抓紧时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me hear it, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.72,0:31:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她亲吻我的伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She kisses my boo-boos.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.55,0:31:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为我束起发辫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She braids my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.47,0:31:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈妈无人能比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother is beyond compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.30,0:31:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你 亲爱的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you, mothers everywhere."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.18,0:31:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是 让人眼前一亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that was, something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.84,0:31:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你最后的那个微笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really like the way you smiled at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.08,0:31:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再来一次 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.76,0:31:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微别那么像僵尸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a tinsy-bit less like a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.98,0:31:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.23,0:31:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她亲吻我的伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She kisses my boo-boos.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.78,0:31:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为我束起发辫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She braids my hair…"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.28,0:31:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美 我该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect! Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.29,0:31:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我不该去表演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I should do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.32,0:31:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha… what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.35,0:31:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.21,0:31:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本就没有妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even have a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.30,0:31:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定要有妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.64,0:31:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能表演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.73,0:31:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.59,0:32:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参加了退伍军人节的游行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did the Veterans Day pageant.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.53,0:32:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你并没上过战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.22,0:32:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.84,0:32:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你可以用你的想象力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then, maybe you can just use your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.03,0:32:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 我假装有个妈妈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, I pretend I have a mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 你能做到吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? You can do that, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.38,0:32:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能 我一直都是这么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! I do that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.61,0:32:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.02,0:32:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.13,0:32:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.28,0:32:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.47,0:32:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 杰瑞 帮我看好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, Jerry, watch the girls for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.62,0:33:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴夫 斯图尔特 跟我过来 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dave, Stewart, come this way, with me. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.95,0:33:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.85,0:33:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.23,0:34:49.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莎莎餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.75,0:35:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是潜行的忍者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're stealth ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.68,0:35:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无声无息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We make no sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.10,0:35:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.69,0:35:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 猛爷 你死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, El Macho, you're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.08,0:35:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.11,0:35:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.58,0:35:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.18,0:35:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有激光警报器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking for laser beam alarm triggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.14,0:35:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是家餐厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.23,0:35:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可说不准这家伙会设什么样的陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know what kind of booby traps this guy could've set.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.65,0:35:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.71,0:35:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.22,0:35:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hah! Booby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.38,0:35:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh… it's a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.00,0:35:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗 小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you lost, little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.32,0:35:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是迷路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.16,0:35:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞笑 看门鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hah! Some guard dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.41,0:35:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.11,0:35:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把它赶走 快把它赶走 快把它赶走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me! Get it off of me! Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.26,0:36:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.24,0:36:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.09,0:36:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只鸡到底怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with that chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.71,0:36:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡鸡复叽叽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that Pollo is Loco.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.22,0:36:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.57,0:36:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.47,0:36:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You getting anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.75,0:36:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.68,0:36:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.55,0:36:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 看看用X光眼镜可以发现点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hey, maybe you can find something with these X-ray goggles!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.48,0:37:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用吗 告诉我 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it working, tell me, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.15,0:37:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 有什么不对头吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.81,0:37:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这景象我会永生难忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is an image I'll never get out of my brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.07,0:37:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.60,0:37:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum's in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.03,0:37:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快去拿吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, then let's get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.48,0:37:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is going to be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.93,0:37:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.71,0:37:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是 莎莎酱吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, Salsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.36,0:37:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 怎么会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aww, man…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.63,0:37:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人今晚要玩完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody is going to die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.38,0:38:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 宝利特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Paulito!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.73,0:38:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝利特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulito,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝利特 你能听见我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulito, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.49,0:38:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然会对这小萌鸡下毒手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would do this to such a sweet little chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.59,0:38:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.49,0:38:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不出来 我就进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming out, or am I gonna go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.75,0:38:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.92,0:38:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.38,0:38:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 叫你的小不点们过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru, call in your munchkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.88,0:38:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出动 来救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it started, come get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.20,0:38:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离真「近」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oooh. So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.59,0:38:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.14,0:38:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.86,0:38:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.58,0:39:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.60,0:39:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.78,0:39:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 冰淇淋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay! Ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.98,0:40:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 他在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru! There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.84,0:40:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌疑犯八号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspect number 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗洛伊德·秃鹰君{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floyd Eagle-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.50,0:40:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.17,0:41:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试能不能靠近点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.36,0:41:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.48,0:41:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.43,0:41:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.06,0:41:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.40,0:41:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.37,0:41:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.11,0:41:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.74,0:41:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.65,0:41:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.09,0:41:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想来看看你工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we thought we'd come visit you at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.97,0:41:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在垃圾桶里拯救世界吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saving the world in a garbage can?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.48,0:41:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.11,0:41:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.36,0:41:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.75,0:41:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 她们是我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, these are my girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.76,0:41:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格 伊迪丝和艾格妮丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo, Edith and Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.98,0:41:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们 这是露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.45,0:41:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 这是姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.80,0:41:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.79,0:41:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.25,0:42:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你单身吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you single?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.23,0:42:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.43,0:42:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey! I have an idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.92,0:42:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西和我有很多事情要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since Lucy and I have lots of work to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.19,0:42:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么不去逛街呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you girls go and explore the mall?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.94,0:42:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这些钱 去买些没用的玩意吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is some money, go buy some useless mall junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.96,0:42:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,头绳什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some headbands…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.64,0:42:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会娶露西吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna marry Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.31,0:42:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your gorf?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.17,0:42:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 她只是个同事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! She just works with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.42,0:42:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱上她啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.72,0:42:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.61,0:42:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.39,0:42:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的真的很爱她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really, really love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.10,0:42:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.96,0:42:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道 我连喜欢她都谈不上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are sordid lies. I don't even like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.55,0:42:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去玩吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.58,0:42:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.61,0:42:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你拯救世界好运 拜拜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck saving the world! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.01,0:42:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.76,0:42:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.28,0:42:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们可真 好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're, funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.08,0:42:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些女孩很崇拜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those girls totally adore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.29,0:42:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你是个有趣的爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're a fun dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.77,0:42:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我超有趣的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. I'm pretty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.95,0:43:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是偷窃行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.25,0:43:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的愿望是一百个免费硬币就不算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if my wish was to ever get a hundred free coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.53,0:43:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,雨天终究会放晴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This rainy day is temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.82,0:43:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,人海中他鹤立鸡群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The contrast is why we got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.95,0:43:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光在那乌云后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause sunshine due is just a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.12,0:43:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,后后后 吼吼吼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away way way way way way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.48,0:43:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,吼吼吼 吼吼吼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way way way way way way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.85,0:43:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一时失意又怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you blown a fuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.40,0:43:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生低谷人人有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that happens to us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.61,0:43:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,风水总是轮流转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I come with great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.71,0:43:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卷土再重来 来来来 唻唻唻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day could change. Change change change.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.41,0:43:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜真棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.80,0:43:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫安东尼奥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Antonio.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.43,0:43:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.40,0:43:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要去吃甜点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just going to get a cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.69,0:43:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一起来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care to join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.87,0:43:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh… sure…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.63,0:43:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.45,0:44:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过一会再来找你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm… I'll catch up with you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.95,0:44:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.08,0:44:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说「好恶心」吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I be the first to say, "Eww"!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.68,0:44:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须告诉格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go tell Gru!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.14,0:44:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.95,0:44:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有血清的迹象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it picks up any traces of the serum,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.74,0:44:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的皮带扣就会发出这样的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the center of your belt buckle will make a sound like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.84,0:44:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我听到了 听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.50,0:44:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.22,0:44:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到秃鹰美发俱乐部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to "Eagle Hair Club".
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是时候来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time you showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.67,0:44:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.34,0:44:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的名字吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.44,0:44:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当头顶缺毛的人走进商场时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When someone moves into the mall who is follically challenged,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.25,0:44:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就有责任去了解他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make it my business to know all about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.63,0:44:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都秃了 真是可怜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bald. And that is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.61,0:45:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好呆着 小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, my sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.76,0:45:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有任何发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting nothing so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.19,0:45:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你得到处找找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you need to look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.55,0:45:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦 这个挺有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, this looks interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.11,0:45:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.64,0:45:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你是一位艺术爱好者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you're an art lover?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.03,0:45:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.79,0:45:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么爱好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.79,0:45:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个迷人的小玩意又是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how about this impressive trinket?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.41,0:45:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是小玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hardly call it trinket,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.67,0:45:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格鲁先生 国际…-没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Gru. International… - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.40,0:45:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.02,0:45:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我收到信号了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, I'm picking up something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.37,0:45:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在墙后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind that wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.24,0:45:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh… What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.34,0:45:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是试戴的假发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my trial wigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.76,0:45:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该拿一顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.49,0:45:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,免了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.58,0:45:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙那边是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's on the other side of the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.96,0:45:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这人 看着我 集中精力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are! Look at me! Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.94,0:45:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.64,0:45:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 这假发会彻底改变你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, that this wig will transform you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.77,0:45:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,告别丑陋 重塑魅力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from ugly, to irresistible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.89,0:46:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格交男朋友啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo has a boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.50,0:46:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还去约会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're going on a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.44,0:46:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会 男朋友 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Date?! Boyfriend?! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.84,0:46:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去那边了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.03,0:46:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是风趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.77,0:46:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.06,0:46:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看 他们相爱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, they're in love!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.45,0:46:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别那么说 他们可没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no. Do not say that they're… no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.62,0:46:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的梦想是 有一天 能以玩游戏为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my dream, is to one day, play video games for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.91,0:46:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是有思想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.52,0:46:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.12,0:46:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.34,0:46:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是 安东尼奥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sellama, Antonio.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.96,0:46:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是 玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mellamo, Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.68,0:46:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拍一我拍一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mellamo Lama Ding Dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.17,0:46:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.87,0:46:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.73,0:47:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,周二免费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it free on Tuesdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.56,0:47:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.43,0:47:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你太高兴了 老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good to see you again, mi compadre!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.22,0:47:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你已经认识我爸爸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… I see you have already met my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.96,0:47:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the… father?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.86,0:47:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 世界太疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si! Look at this crazy small world we live in, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.50,0:48:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来坐下 让我招待你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, sit! Let me get you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.20,0:48:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.75,0:48:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.28,0:48:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 宝利特通常都{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… I'm sorry. Paulito is usually,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.31,0:48:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很友好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.81,0:48:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨晚受惊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a rough night.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.93,0:48:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我们真的要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we really should be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.88,0:48:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.68,0:48:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.67,0:48:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的爱情 多美好啊 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young love, is beautiful, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.27,0:48:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.45,0:48:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们才没相爱 他们压根不怎么认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not in love. They hardly know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.10,0:48:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对 大哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are right, cabeza del nuevo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.04,0:48:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须好好了解下对方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must get to know each other better.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.77,0:48:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼奥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antonio,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.77,0:48:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不邀请你的女友及其家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you invite your girlfriend? And her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.89,0:48:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加我们的五月五派对呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To our Cinco De Mayo party.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.62,0:48:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.83,0:48:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sì!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.66,0:49:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你是说猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, El Macho?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.99,0:49:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎莎酱乌龙事件后他不是解除嫌疑了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we eliminated him as a suspect after the whole "Salsa" Incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.42,0:49:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过有新情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but there has been a new development,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.76,0:49:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 就是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm telling you, this is the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.96,0:49:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须立刻拘捕他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to arrest him immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.33,0:49:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.49,0:49:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那帅到爆的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His deviously charming son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.93,0:49:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定他儿子也有份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure that the son is involved too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.99,0:49:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son, also!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.25,0:49:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须抓住他儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get the son!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.04,0:49:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他儿子才是主谋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that the son is the mastermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.84,0:49:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那种神情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a look,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.88,0:49:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼中透着邪恶 我恨死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a devilish look in his eyes, and I don't like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.83,0:49:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但是我没有看到任何证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I don't believe seeing any evidence…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.97,0:49:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据个屁 我相信直觉 直觉告诉了我 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidence, schmevidence, I go with my gut, and my gut tells me,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.15,0:49:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要找的人就是猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this guy is El Macho.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.76,0:49:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他关起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock him up,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.97,0:49:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lock up the son,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.40,0:49:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了他儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't forget about the son!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.75,0:49:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子 让我不寒而栗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid, gives me the creeps!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.10,0:49:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 天哪 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear, oh dear, oh dear…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.12,0:49:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情也有好的一面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, on the less crazy side of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.02,0:49:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁在秃鹰美发会所找到了血清的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru discovered traces of the serum at Eagle Hair Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.28,0:49:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.04,0:50:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是谁办到的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! And you know who made that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.71,0:50:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 搞定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy. Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.92,0:50:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.75,0:50:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.59,0:50:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 但犯人不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, but it's not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.12,0:50:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is El Macho…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.75,0:50:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Gru,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.92,0:50:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.61,0:50:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是猛爷 我会证明给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is him and I will prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.32,0:50:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.05,0:50:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的以为是猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really thinks it's El Macho.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.16,0:50:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看出来了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.85,0:50:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏日姗姗 天气炎炎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the summer time when the weather is high.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.87,0:50:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝蓝天空 触手可及{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stretch right up and touch the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.67,0:50:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当天气静好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the weather's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.07,0:50:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,海边垂钓 海里畅游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go fishin' or go swimmin' in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.31,0:50:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心又快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're always happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.91,0:50:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受生活 才是人生真谛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's for livin' yeah, that's our philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.19,0:51:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一起唱起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.57,0:51:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很欢乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah we're hap-happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.69,0:51:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.87,0:51:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.47,0:51:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线网断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wi-fi's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.36,0:51:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.77,0:51:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lex,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.70,0:51:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文到底哪去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the heck is Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.89,0:51:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得回顾一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, we need to revisit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.69,0:51:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的休假时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the number of vacation days you guys get.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.95,0:51:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都到哪里撒欢去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find anybody anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.44,0:51:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 我是吉莉安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru, it's Jillian!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.04,0:51:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个好消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.26,0:52:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了朋友珊侬过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my friend Shannon here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.56,0:52:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩可以出去吃吃饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking you two could get some grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.66,0:52:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,开怀畅饮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, tear it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.87,0:52:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.15,0:52:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.56,0:52:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格妮丝 艾格妮丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes! Agnes,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.31,0:52:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉吉莉安 我不在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell Jillian, I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.86,0:52:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁不在家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.41,0:52:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.91,0:52:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他刚说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he just told me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.14,0:52:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 不 他没说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean no, he didn't just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.49,0:52:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格妮丝 格鲁在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes, where is Gru?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.78,0:52:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在 抹口红{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, putting on lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.13,0:52:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在 打苍蝇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, swatting a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.15,0:52:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在 割脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, chopping a head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.59,0:52:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在 便便{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's… pooping?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.92,0:52:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在家 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.83,0:52:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你逃不掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way you're getting out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.70,0:52:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说我一开始很紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell you I was so nervous about tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.78,0:52:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头那么多骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean there's just so many phonies out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.94,0:52:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.26,0:53:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你常健身吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do you work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.73,0:53:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.46,0:53:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, obviously you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.22,0:53:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会考虑去健身吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But would you consider it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.04,0:53:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,身材对珊侬来说可是非常重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Physical fitness is very important to Shannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.52,0:53:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看的出来 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can tell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.86,0:53:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.92,0:53:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.87,0:53:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在餐厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in a restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.50,0:53:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 露西点的外带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, take out for Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.21,0:53:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 稍等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.68,0:53:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你口音太奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your accent is so exotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.54,0:53:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah…Well, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.95,0:53:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我原来 - 我有个认识的人能帮到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was…- I know someone who can fix that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.90,0:53:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能改掉口音了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll be talking normal in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.80,0:53:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里好热啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew… Is it hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.44,0:53:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西好吃吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.18,0:53:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, wait a minute…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.47,0:54:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是戴假发吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you wearing a wig?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.96,0:54:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.05,0:54:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.01,0:54:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.29,0:54:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a phony.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.43,0:54:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我痛恨骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate phonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.58,0:54:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我的头发是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… what? No, these locks are all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.84,0:54:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 根本不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.08,0:54:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我要做什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.47,0:54:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它 从你的脑袋上扯下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna rip that thing off your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.35,0:54:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家都知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and show everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.10,0:54:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个秃头大骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a bald-headed phony you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.37,0:54:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想 这位小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so, Miss Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.60,0:54:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.85,0:54:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 你怎么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.16,0:54:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.35,0:54:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.23,0:54:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.22,0:54:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.60,0:54:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的约会对象醉倒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, looks like your date's out for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.09,0:54:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像有人给她打了一针镇定剂似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like she's been shot with a mild tranquilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.29,0:54:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noooo…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.90,0:54:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼睛意思是 我真的给她打了镇定剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm winking 'cause that's what actually happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.85,0:54:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excusi, what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.95,0:54:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不喜欢吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She no like?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.97,0:54:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's just, uhh…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.24,0:54:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Oh-ho-ho… Sì! Sì.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.62,0:55:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们送她回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we take her home?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.58,0:55:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚的约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.10,0:55:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,堪称史上最糟约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just officially had the worst date ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.23,0:55:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.11,0:55:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.22,0:55:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后总不至于比这更糟 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can only get better from here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.32,0:55:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真的更糟 我的飞镖枪借你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it doesn't, you can always borrow my dart gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.64,0:55:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有几次就派上用场了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do use it on, one or two dates myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.18,0:55:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,和约会比起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know as far as dates go,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.12,0:56:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得独自一人更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm good with just, the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.25,0:56:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.94,0:56:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 的确是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, surprisingly, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.43,0:56:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,私下告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and just between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.62,0:56:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你光头更好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look much better bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.93,0:56:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.71,0:56:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来很疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might seem crazy what I'm about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.52,0:56:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光明媚 一身轻松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunshine she's here, you can take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.48,0:56:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像个要升空的热气球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hot air balloon that could go to space.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.08,0:56:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 约会很顺利吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I take it the date went well?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.54,0:56:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 糟糕透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.57,0:56:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都无所谓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I don't care baby by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.11,0:56:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.66,0:56:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也无忧无虑 就一起拍拍手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clap along if you feel like a room without a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.30,0:56:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.58,0:57:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也快乐至上 就一起拍拍手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clap along if you feel like happiness is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.37,0:57:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.53,0:57:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你懂快乐的重要性 就一起拍拍手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clap along if you know what happiness is to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.15,0:57:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.54,0:57:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你正想拍手 就一起拍拍手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clap along if you feel like that's what you wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.77,0:57:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不能令我沮丧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me down, can't nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.85,0:57:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不可能让我悲伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me Down, my level is too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.00,0:57:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不能令我沮丧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me down, can't nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.72,0:57:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不悲伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me down, I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.12,0:57:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也无忧无虑 就一起拍拍手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clap along if you feel like a room without a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.58,0:57:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.32,0:57:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也怀揣梦想 就一起拍拍手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clap along if you know what's best what you wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.65,0:57:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰皮谷先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ramsbottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.21,0:57:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.72,0:57:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.98,0:57:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.07,0:57:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到谁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got who?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.29,0:57:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗洛伊德·秃鹰君{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floyd Eagle-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.71,0:57:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工昨晚找到了他店里的密室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our agents located a secret room in his shop last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.84,0:57:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.40,0:57:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}discovered this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.85,0:58:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经空了 但还有少量PX-41血清残留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty but we found traces of the PX-41 serum in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.17,0:58:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.40,0:58:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然没指望上你 但我们还是搞定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, somehow, in spite of your incompetence, we solved this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.31,0:58:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被陷害的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was framed!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.92,0:58:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你逃不掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.41,0:58:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的脏手拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your mitts off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.44,0:58:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.73,0:58:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.04,0:58:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以回去忙你的生意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, you're free to go back to your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.53,0:58:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,果酱和果冻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmmm! Jams and jellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.01,0:58:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而瓦尔德特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looks like Agent Wilde.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.48,0:58:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被调到澳大利亚分部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be transferring to our Australian branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.57,0:58:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,澳大利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Australia?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.00,0:58:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.01,0:58:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你所做的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thank you, for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.77,0:58:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你什么也没做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by everything, of course I mean, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.06,0:58:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己保重吧 格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toodles and cheerio, Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.12,0:58:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.03,0:58:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.25,0:58:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.62,0:58:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.88,0:58:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.84,0:58:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去澳大利亚了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're going to Australia?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.89,0:58:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没最终确定下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not definite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.15,0:58:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在考虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still figuring it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.75,0:58:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开始练习口音了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already been working on my accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.82,0:58:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[模仿澳大利亚口音]
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.17,0:58:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,休·杰克曼（澳大利亚演员）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hugh Jackman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.45,0:59:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很兴奋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.68,0:59:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.14,0:59:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.78,0:59:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.88,0:59:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.10,0:59:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 我想把这个送给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here. I wanted to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.23,0:59:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口红枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lipstick taser?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.93,0:59:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 算是个留念吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's just a memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.85,0:59:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.72,0:59:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们初次见面时我用的那支{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From, the first time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.16,0:59:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Thank you, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦尔德特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Wilde?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.21,0:59:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在叫你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like they need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.63,0:59:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.35,0:59:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.99,0:59:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.18,0:59:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.00,1:00:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了把伞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you an umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.01,1:00:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.94,1:00:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.37,1:00:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你说过我喜欢露西吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when you said that I liked Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.06,1:00:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it turns out…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.33,1:00:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.11,1:00:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.27,1:00:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.38,1:00:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就要搬走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's moving away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.02,1:00:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也见不到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never going to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.55,1:00:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮得上忙吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything I can do to help?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.93,1:00:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.91,1:00:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.88,1:00:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你自己能做点什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well is there anything you could do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.05,1:00:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 露西 我是格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Lucy. This is Gru.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.55,1:01:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.64,1:01:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to this point,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.74,1:01:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的关系仅限于工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our relationship has been strictly professional.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.38,1:01:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你就要前往澳大利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're leaving for Australia and all…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.44,1:01:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.11,1:01:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here is the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.16,1:01:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿不愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.09,1:01:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我出去约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.78,1:01:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ayyy… No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.96,1:01:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's not helping.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.07,1:01:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.29,1:01:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次来真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.12,1:01:28.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（露西·瓦尔德 电话（626） 584-5923）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.94,1:01:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.07,1:01:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.61,1:03:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,五月五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cinco de mayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.72,1:03:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,五月五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cinco de mayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.74,1:03:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方太炫了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.39,1:03:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去玩吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's party!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.58,1:03:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 我们重温一下规矩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, first, let us go over the rules!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.05,1:03:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有规矩哪有欢乐呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, what is fun without the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.17,1:03:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格妮丝 别吃太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes, easy on the churros.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.44,1:03:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊迪丝 不许杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edith, try to not kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.91,1:04:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.86,1:04:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 格鲁先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Gru.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.04,1:04:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argh… okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.46,1:04:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.42,1:04:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和男孩之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be a standard 6 feet of space,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.41,1:04:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少保持6英尺距离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.25,1:04:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是这个男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially this boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.72,1:04:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真幽默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you are a funny man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.38,1:04:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有规矩 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no rules, señor.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.98,1:04:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是五月五节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Cinco De Mayo!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.19,1:04:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 尽情欢乐吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's party and relax!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.30,1:05:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.34,1:05:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 什么事都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing. Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.42,1:05:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在试着冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just chilling.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.71,1:05:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,蘸着鳄梨酱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the guac,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.65,1:05:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我的薯片帽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from my chip hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.16,1:05:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.31,1:05:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太清楚这种表情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that look all too well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.85,1:05:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是心碎的表情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the look of a broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.22,1:05:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.67,1:05:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.89,1:05:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾在无数个夜晚中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, too, have spent many nights.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.26,1:05:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想将内心的悲伤深埋于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to drown my sorrows,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.55,1:05:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳄梨色拉酱中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Guacamole.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.23,1:05:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.31,1:05:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.15,1:05:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.11,1:05:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挺过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.26,1:05:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们远远不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is much more to us,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.11,1:05:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面看起来那么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.24,1:06:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩的开心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the party.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.74,1:07:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.22,1:07:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想来点花生仁或小脆饼吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like some peanuts or pretzels?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.70,1:08:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笑话真有意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.74,1:08:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚拉了粑粑哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did a boom-boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.97,1:08:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您赶快做出选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really need you to make a choice now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.75,1:08:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose Gru.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.14,1:08:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.89,1:08:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 格鲁空中小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Gru stewardess!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.75,1:08:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.89,1:09:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是那么厉害 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not lost your touch, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.38,1:09:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.09,1:09:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are El Macho.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.61,1:09:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.67,1:09:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody believed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.63,1:09:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道你根本没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I knew you weren't dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.69,1:09:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.85,1:09:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是诈死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I merely faked my death.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.02,1:09:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.03,1:09:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for me,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.38,1:09:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,回归邪恶的完美时刻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make a spectacular return to evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.82,1:09:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.60,1:09:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得现在是时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.23,1:09:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给格鲁展示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to show Gru,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.81,1:09:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的研究成果了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we're up to here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.33,1:09:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼法里奥博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Nefario?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.27,1:09:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you, Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.70,1:09:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的新工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whaaa… So this is your new job opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.33,1:09:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.78,1:09:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会喜欢这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.52,1:09:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我借用了你的小不点们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I had to borrow some of your minions,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.67,1:09:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对物有所值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was for a worthy cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.79,1:09:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oooh… Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.46,1:10:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他已经不是凯文了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he is not Kevin anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.09,1:10:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.99,1:10:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个坚不可摧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is an indestructible,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.13,1:10:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会思考的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}mindless,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.10,1:10:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing machine!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.60,1:10:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.93,1:10:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,最厉害的就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's the best part:
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.09,1:10:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有整整一支军队呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an army of them!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.92,1:10:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.80,1:10:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会把它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will unleash them,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.10,1:10:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放到世界各处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.65,1:10:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if anyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.03,1:10:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图阻止它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}anyone tries to stop them…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.35,1:10:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那座城市就会被吃掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city gets eaten!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.17,1:10:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do it together!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.24,1:10:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.11,1:10:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.70,1:11:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来我一直钦佩你的工作成果 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have admired your work for years, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.68,1:11:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗月大计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealing the moon?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.71,1:11:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直太赞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.89,1:11:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们定会势不可挡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.30,1:11:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men like you,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.68,1:11:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}men like me…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.94,1:11:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能够统治世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, should be ruling the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.24,1:11:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 加入吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you in?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.97,1:11:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 也许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.53,1:11:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.56,1:11:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 当然 当然加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yes! Yes, Of course, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.36,1:11:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我现在手头上有事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, have a lot going on right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.15,1:11:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们占领地球之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to get some things off my plate,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.93,1:11:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得先把这些事解决了再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we start taking over the world, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.69,1:11:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.39,1:11:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事 我一定加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, forget it. 100%, I am in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.86,1:11:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音 你们听见了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, what is that? Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.00,1:11:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是艾格妮丝在叫我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. That's Agnes calling me, from undis…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.56,1:11:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally in!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.88,1:11:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我不觉得他会加入我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I am not so convinced that he is in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.59,1:12:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊迪丝 艾格妮丝 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edith, Agnes, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.06,1:12:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.60,1:12:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go home now!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.75,1:12:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Margo?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.01,1:12:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.29,1:12:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We're…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.73,1:12:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.21,1:12:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.03,1:12:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他们最讨厌了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they stink.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.63,1:12:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过亲爱的 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sorry, honey, we got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.19,1:13:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.24,1:13:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝利特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Paulito.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.88,1:13:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.03,1:13:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 爱德华多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, Eduardo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.31,1:13:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucia.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.39,1:13:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 宝利特平常不这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize. Paulito, is usually not like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.26,1:13:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次它也是这样对…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same thing happened the other day with…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.55,1:13:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对格鲁的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Gru…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.84,1:13:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of Gru,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.41,1:13:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧见他了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.16,1:13:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really need to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.50,1:13:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他就在这附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I think he's somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.91,1:13:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩很亲密吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are close, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.72,1:13:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.57,1:13:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 也没那么亲密啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, close, I wouldn't say we're, "Close".
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.12,1:13:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们很亲密吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, did he say we're close?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.03,1:13:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他亲口说的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.93,1:13:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他倒没这么说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what he did say.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.58,1:13:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.21,1:13:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从没说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he never mentioned…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.94,1:13:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都在反恶人联盟工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you were both working for the Anti-Villain League!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.29,1:13:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.56,1:14:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funky.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.94,1:14:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华多真的就是猛爷吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Eduardo's actually El Macho?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.70,1:14:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.44,1:14:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一点都不厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is not cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.98,1:14:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一眼就看穿他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once I pretty much knew it was him all along,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.46,1:14:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以还是我比较厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if anyone's cool, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.71,1:14:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.60,1:14:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 尼法里奥博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dr. Nefario.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.78,1:14:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛爷盯上你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}El Macho's onto you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.86,1:14:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你是反恶人联盟的人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows you're working for the AVL.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.56,1:14:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他抓了你的搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, he's got your partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.10,1:14:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.05,1:14:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's, impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.96,1:14:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去澳大利亚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on her way to Australia.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.98,1:14:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼法里奥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nefario!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.62,1:14:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.21,1:14:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓了露西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.60,1:14:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓不了多久的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.54,1:14:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.36,1:14:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去把她救出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting her out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.54,1:16:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.52,1:16:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.42,1:16:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的独角兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My unicorn!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.33,1:16:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾格妮丝 快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.68,1:17:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.89,1:17:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.70,1:17:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.03,1:17:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.94,1:17:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼法里奥博士 你回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Nefario! You're back!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.95,1:17:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如假包换{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.34,1:17:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还带着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.79,1:17:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Antidote.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.15,1:18:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.11,1:18:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些烂果冻终于能派上用场了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time we put this horrible jelly to some good use.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.91,1:18:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩给我专心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Guys! Come on! Stay focus here!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.00,1:19:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curses!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.03,1:19:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,又栽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foiled again!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.61,1:19:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩把我抓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys captured me!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.11,1:20:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up that tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.40,1:20:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.82,1:21:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.14,1:21:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 尼法里奥博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Nice work, Dr. Nefario!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.02,1:21:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药都掺进果冻里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put all antidote in the jelly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.53,1:21:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我很愿意造出邪恶军队来毁灭世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm happy to create an evil army to destroy the world…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.61,1:21:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁都别想对付我的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nobody messes with my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.50,1:21:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.69,1:21:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我们去救…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's go get the…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.81,1:21:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.99,1:21:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把孩子们也带来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought the girls?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.98,1:21:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.35,1:21:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Is that wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.82,1:21:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的怪物军怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening… to my minions?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.50,1:21:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.37,1:21:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 去解决剩下的怪物军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, take care of the rest of the minions.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.18,1:21:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去救露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to find Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.58,1:22:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝果冻的厉害 长毛怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat jelly, you furry freaks!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.52,1:22:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, El Macho.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.26,1:22:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where is Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.00,1:22:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.60,1:22:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hey, Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.94,1:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了 他果然是那个什么猛爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out you were right about the Polo Macho thing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.67,1:23:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一按这个按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One push of this button,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.42,1:23:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭就会发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I send that rocket,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.32,1:23:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,径直冲进那个我诈死的火山里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}straight into the same volcano where I faked my death.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.80,1:23:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this time…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.30,1:23:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次真的会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for real.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.83,1:23:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.36,1:23:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本可一起统治世界的 格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have ruled the world together, Gru.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.38,1:23:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.27,1:23:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着受死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.48,1:24:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,口红枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lipstick taser!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.98,1:24:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他居然学我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aww. He copied me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.42,1:24:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not afraid,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.84,1:24:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个果冻枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your jelly guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.69,1:25:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可不是果冻枪 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this ain't a jelly gun, Sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.24,1:25:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 格鲁 我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me, Gru, I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.46,1:25:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这更糟糕的我都经历过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have survived lots worse than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.07,1:25:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 其实没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's not entirely true.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.22,1:25:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快吓死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually I'm kinda freaking out up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.43,1:25:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会救你出去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I will get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.15,1:25:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真讨厌这只鸡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really hate that chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.47,1:26:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是剪红线吗 一定是红线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a red one? It's definitely the red one!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.11,1:26:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.83,1:26:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time now!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.32,1:26:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 我们这次可能没命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, we may not get out of this alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.02,1:26:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我得问你个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I need to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.93,1:26:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可得快点问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh… Better make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.13,1:26:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我约你出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I asked you out on a date,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.00,1:26:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会同意吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have said?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.00,1:26:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.28,1:26:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.70,1:26:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.46,1:26:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.44,1:26:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 你在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.66,1:26:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah… Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.87,1:26:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,格鲁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gru!!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.11,1:26:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.09,1:26:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你得留着手划水呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you, kinda need your arms to tread water, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.49,1:27:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.51,1:27:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,147次约会后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}147 dates later…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.43,1:28:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说「好恶心」吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I be the first to say, eww!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.78,1:28:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.23,1:28:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.34,1:28:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.91,1:29:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.18,1:29:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话要说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to make some toast…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.23,1:29:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.52,1:29:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… umm…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.95,1:29:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她亲吻我的伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kisses my boo-boos.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.28,1:29:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为我束起发辫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She braids my hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.32,1:29:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你 亲爱的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We Love You Mothers Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.62,1:29:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新妈妈露西无人能比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my new Mom Lucy is beyond compare.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.66,1:29:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为新娘和格鲁举杯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bride! And Gru!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.27,1:30:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so happy!
